      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Respiratory diseases are a relatively common cause of illness and death in cage birds. A diagnostic algorithm is provided based on history, physical examination, and ancillary diagnostic findings that assist clinicians in determining the cause of a bird's respiratory disease. Also included are detailed descriptions of the common respiratory diseases of cage birds and their treatment."},
